			"notes": "* Added support for 26.3\n### Features\n* Added progress/h to dye panel overlay\n* Option to play dye drop sound when someone in your lobby gets a dye\n### Changes\n* Added new progress format “Chance to get at least X dyes”\n    * Configure X by holding shift while clicking\n* Sorting in the dye menu now saves\n* Made ETA in dye panel overlay toggleable (default is off)\n* Added Refractive Paint Palette to dye tracker\n   * If you already consumed this, then you will need to enable it in the config under “General”\n* Made pearlescent guide more detailed\n* Improved periwinkle guide\n### Fixes\n* Pure white guide mentioning pure black\n* Removed mention of crow pet in nyanza guide\n* Fixed dye rotation stat formatting with decrease in stats\n* Fixed bone and periwinkle trackers not working in dungeons"
		},
