			"notes": "### Features\n* Custom dye sounds\n    * Plays a custom sound when you drop a dye\n    * Put .ogg sound files in your config/dyeaddons/sounds folder and do /dyeaddons reloadsounds\n* Dye Rotation Stats\n    * Shows how much stats you gained during a dye rotation\n    * Only works if you looked at dye rotation during a rotation\n* Medal Integration\n    * Auto clipping for dye drops\n* Time since last dye messages\n    * Shows a message of how long it was since your last dye/unique dye\n* Formatting for progress\n* Quick start command \n    * Instantly load stats/progress from api\n### Changes\n* Removed spammy log messages\n* Added charming visitors to copper calculator\n* Added 2x and 3x categories for statistics\n* Improved welcome message\n### Fixes\n* Optimized overlays to not build every frame\n* Typo in debug config\n* Runebook overwriting runic kills"
		},
